          - レジスタが \"r で入力された\n                                - コマンドの実行途中\n                                - マップの実行中\n                                - 先行入力がある\n                                - 挿入モード補完がアクティブ\n                                - コマンドライン補完がアクティブ\n                                `mode()` を使用して、Vimの状態を確認できる。\n                                それは以下かもしれない:\n                                - ビジュアルモード\n                                - ノーマルモード\n                                - 挿入モード\n                                - コマンドラインモード\n                                やりたいことによっては、`state()` でさらに\n                                チェックすることもできる。例えば、画面がメッ\n                                セージのためにスクロールされたかどうか。\n```","ts":"1632749596.385800","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"0bca175f-9acd-414e-9f0d-1074fddc024f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h SafeState","ts":"1632749595.385700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bi0r6"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"\u003c@UPZHKAM7W\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1632749591.385500","subtype":"channel_join","inviter":"U9S4G0LJW","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"9d5b2d08-6168-45ed-b006-2f91b0789cf1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ここいない気がしてきた","ts":"1632749575.385300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eO+p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3650ef3-5f35-4b17-81dc-4e2b6b22174d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":":h SafeState","ts":"1632749571.385100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JopdZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee657f7a-6728-4ef4-a8cc-6e1a4c620004","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"SafeState is ?","ts":"1632749562.384900","team":"T