cb694c1b-ded6-47c3-91a9-1d8ba418984f","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"Neovim だと問題なく動くと思います","ts":"1632749114.377200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YPs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02fe4ff6-a612-49b6-873f-265a10330e5b","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"なので `skkeleton#getchar()` が RPC の流れの中で呼ばれているなら or `timer_start` で呼ばれているなら `echo` は一瞬で消えます。ただし Vim 限定","ts":"1632749102.376700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ibsa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"040c0d05-da08-46c1-b2b3-ccfaa952c80e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"非同期プログラミングの :nanido:","ts":"1632749085.376300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hgzvQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7677833-c489-4c56-b51b-9e700a0dd970","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"timer とかには rpc とかも含みます","ts":"1632749059.375700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TO/I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"530c200f-7c33-4e7a-8dc2-1402addfb576","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"echo で止めたいならかなりアホみたいなハックが必要","ts":"1632749041.375500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GgKy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9cb55c00-1f1c-457f-97ad-8a2fd1afc815","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"timer とかから呼ばれた echo は止めないですよ","ts":"1632749021.375200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"njA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c0f653f-3435-46cb-82ed-b0a7a6982ea6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"eskk.vim は問題ないので、どうやってるのか見てみてもいいかも","ts":"1632748857.374900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CU3br"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67b1104b-4de2-495e-9083-4b536cd5e557","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"その後すぐにプロンプトを表示するコードが走ってそうな挙動でしたね。一応 `x` を押すと変換を逆順に戻ることはできました","ts":"1632748837.374500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CRhf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b34bb26-c35b-4bbe-b09b-96321e174ada","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あのメッセージ出してるのこの部分なんですが、これで消えるのが解せないんですよね\n\u003chttps://github.com/vim-skk/denops-skkeleton.vim/blob/4b317fe68f90072fd52109b38c80abdd34443ed8/autoload/skkeleton.vim#L264-L265\u003e","ts":"1632748759.373500","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-skk/denops-skkeleton.vim/blob/4b317fe68f90072fd52109b38c80abdd34443ed8/autoload/skkeleton.vim | skkeleton.vim\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-skk/denops-skkeleton.vim/blob/4b317fe68f90072fd52109b38c80abdd34443ed8/autoload/skkeleton.vim | skkeleton.vim\u003e","text":"```\n  echo a:msg\n  return getchar()\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-skk/denops-skkeleton.vim|vim-skk/denops-skkeleton.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z5kR7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d93c864f-65bb-4512-a3ae-1df7e10a65ce","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ひとまず Issue にはしておいた。SKK においては割と致命的なレベルな気がします。\n\u003chttps://github.com/vim-skk/denops-skkeleton.vim/issues/29\u003e","ts":"1632748719.373000","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-skk/denops-skkeleton.vim/issues/29|#29 辞書登録中に変換をしようとすると、複数候補の表示が辞書登録プロンプトで消される\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-skk/denops-skkeleton.vim/issues/29|#29 辞書登録中に変換をしようとすると、複数候補の表示が辞書登録プロンプトで消される\u003e","text":"```\n# syntax=docker/dockerfile:1.3-labs\n\nFROM thinca/vim:v8.2.3455-ubuntu\n\nRUN apt-get update \\\n \u0026amp;\u0026amp; DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive apt-get install -y curl unzip \\\n \u0026amp;\u0026amp; curl -sL '\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/releases/download/v1.14.0/deno-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip\u003e' -o /tmp/deno.zip \\\n \u0026amp;\u0026amp; unzip -qd /usr/local/bin /tmp/deno.zip \\\n \u0026amp;\u0026amp; rm /tmp/deno.zip \\\n \u0026amp;\u0026amp; mkdir -p $HOME/.vim/pack/test/start/denops $HOME/.vim/pack/test/start/denops-skkeleton \\\n \u0026amp;\u0026amp; curl -sL \\\n        \"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/archive/v2.0.0.tar.gz\u003e\" | \\\n        tar xz --directory=$HOME/.vim/pack/test/start/denops --strip-components=1 \\\n \u0026amp;\u0026amp; curl -sL \\\n        \"\u003chttps://github.com/kuuote/denops-skkeleton.vim/archive/main.tar.gz\u003e\" | \\\n        tar xz --directory=$HOME/.vim/pack/test/start/denops-skkeleton --strip-components=1 \\\n \u0026amp;\u0026amp; mkdir -p /usr/share/skk \\\n \u0026amp;\u0026amp; curl -sL \u003chttp://openlab.jp/skk/dic/SKK-JISYO.L.gz\u003e | zcat \u0026gt; /usr/share/skk/SKK-JISYO.L\n\nCOPY \u0026lt;\u0026lt;VIMRC /root/.vim/vimrc\nimap \u0026lt;C-j\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(skkeleton-toggle)\ncmap \u0026lt;C-j\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Plug\u0026gt;(skkeleton-toggle)\nVIMRC\n```\n\n```\n$ DOCKER_BUILDKIT=1 docker build -t skkeleton .\n$ docker run --rm -it --name skkeleton -e COLUMNS=\"$(tput cols)\" -e LINES=\"$(tput lines)\" skkeleton\n```\n\n1. 挿入モードで skkeleton を有効にして、適当に変換を行い、辞書登録モードに入る。\n2. 辞書登録モードで漢字変換を行い、4 つ目以降の候補を表示させようとする。\n3. 候補の一覧が一瞬だけ表示されるが、すぐに辞書登録モードのプロンプトが表示されてしまい、候補を選ぶことができない。","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-skk/denops-skkeleton.vim|vim-skk/denops-skkeleton.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1632748687}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=soi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"510b3f1a-ca56-4b4a-b98e-d3e94f67cbb9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"これ de